    'a script, not a browser' => 'skrip, bukan peramban',
    'Recent suspicious attempts' => 'Percobaan mencurigakan terbaru',
    'Kept for 90 days. Three bot attempts in a day block the address for a week. "Evidence" downloads everything from that address as a CSV file to attach to an abuse report to the network provider.' => 'Disimpan selama 90 hari. Tiga percobaan bot dalam sehari memblokir alamat selama seminggu. "Bukti" mengunduh semua catatan alamat itu sebagai file CSV untuk dilampirkan pada laporan penyalahgunaan ke penyedia jaringan.',
    'Points' => 'Poin',
    'Verdict' => 'Putusan',
